# Manual Browser Verification

After making any change to the webapp, you MUST verify it manually in the Browser before considering the task done.

- Open (or reload) the affected page in the Browser
- Visually confirm the change works as intended
- If the change breaks something, fix it and re-verify
- A task is NOT complete until browser verification passes
